{"id": "ethics-legal-defense-fund-penalty-payments", "title": "Two legal defense funds paid London Breed’s $22,792 ethics penalty", "seconds": 40.7, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "tempo": 1.04, "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "78ef5f0366219672", "words": 118, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In 2021 the Ethics Commission approved a $22,792 settlement with Mayor London Breed.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 7.06, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Who", "paid", "the", "penalty"], "sub": "London Breed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.41, 1.54, 1.75, 2.09, 2.47, 2.84, 2.91, 3.31, 3.72, 4.0, 4.26, 4.64, 4.93, 5.59, 5.82, 6.13, 6.47]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "The settlement covered campaign contributions, a prohibited gift and use of the City title.", "t0": 7.18, "t1": 11.73, "shot": "detail0", "visual": {"type": "doc", "kicker": "San Francisco Ethics Commission", "source": "breed", "text": "The settlement covered campaign contributions, a prohibited gift and use of the City title", "mark": "The settlement covered campaign contributions, a prohibited gift and use of the City title"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.55, 0.84, 1.27, 2.31, 2.45, 2.97, 3.32, 3.52, 3.75, 3.85, 3.96, 4.24]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Her mayoral defense fund paid $10,792.", "t0": 11.85, "t1": 15.41, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$10,792", "label": "Mayoral fund"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.52, 0.87, 1.11, 1.36, 1.6, 2.04, 2.33, 2.61, 3.04]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Her supervisor defense fund paid the other $12,000.", "t0": 15.63, "t1": 18.7, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$12,000", "label": "Supervisor fund"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.69, 1.05, 1.36, 1.6, 1.73, 1.95, 2.23, 2.56]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Commission staff traced contributions from Wayne Jordan and Chris Larsen.", "t0": 18.82, "t1": 22.4, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "report", "kicker": "Staff report", "text": "defense fund", "mark": "fund"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.5, 0.89, 1.23, 1.88, 2.07, 2.29, 2.64, 2.75, 2.98]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The funds also covered attorney fees.", "t0": 22.52, "t1": 24.5, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The funds also covered attorney fees"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.44, 0.73, 1.01, 1.36]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Aaron Peskin loaned his fund about $27,000 for costs that included an $8,000 penalty.", "t0": 24.72, "t1": 30.46, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$8,000", "label": "Peskin penalty"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.71, 0.95, 1.1, 1.4, 1.64, 2.22, 2.58, 2.96, 3.13, 3.5, 3.66, 4.1, 4.23, 4.46, 4.78, 5.07]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Staff traced subsequent contributions used to repay that loan.", "t0": 30.58, "t1": 33.7, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "report", "kicker": "Staff report", "text": "repay that loan", "mark": "loan"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.39, 0.75, 1.22, 1.92, 2.12, 2.23, 2.57, 2.77]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "The staff report describes how the penalties and legal costs were financed.", "t0": 33.82, "t1": 37.37, "shot": "detail1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "kicker": "San Francisco Ethics Commission", "source": "peskin", "text": "The staff report describes how the penalties and legal costs were financed", "mark": "The staff report describes how the penalties and legal costs were financed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.42, 0.76, 1.3, 1.42, 1.53, 2.04, 2.15, 2.41, 2.77, 2.93]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in